WEBVTT

00:09:29.898 --> 00:09:32.109
We are going to be different
30 years from now.

00:09:32.151 --> 00:09:36.614
Our need for retribution, for vengeance,
might not be what it is today.

00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:42.703
(Applause)

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:44.997
When we pass laws,

00:09:45.039 --> 00:09:48.167
we often do so with an intent
of making a better country,

00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:49.501
improving our country.

00:09:49.543 --> 00:09:52.713
But any country that's been around
for a few decades

00:09:52.713 --> 00:09:54.298
has numerous laws on the books

00:09:54.298 --> 00:09:56.925
that made perfect sense
when they were crafted --

00:09:56.967 --> 00:10:00.012
in fact, that were seen as enlightened
when they were crafted --